{
  "label": "chikafirsthall",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label chikafirsthall:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall1.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whaaaaaat? No friggin’ way! This can't be happening!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey Chika. What’s going on?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall2.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This can't be happening!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I heard that much. What can't be happening, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, this girl I work with at the mall just got a new puppy, and she taught it friggin' math!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall3.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know, Sensei! Can't you at least be happy for her, though? This is like, a totally huge deal!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Happy for your friend? Or happy for the dog?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The dog, obviously!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, my friend is the one who posted the video online and it's gotten her like a trillion new followers, but the dog is the real hero here! We all know that!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here! Look for yourself. You aren't impressed enough.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall4.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Chika hands me her phone and, sure enough, there is a video of a dog doing math.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That dog is going places, Sensei. It's even better at math than Ami.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don't really understand what I'm watching here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What's not to understand? My friend asks the dog a basic math problem and then it just barks the correct amount of times.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess what I'm really not understanding is why someone would waste their time teaching something like that to an animal.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall5.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...why do you teach people? I'm sure it's probably for the same reason.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your friend was reborn into a world where she was already teaching?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know, maybe. If Kanye West can win 23 Grammys, pretty much anything is possible.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what are you even doing over here? I didn't think boys were allowed in the girls' dorm.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm a special exception to that rule.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it because Ami lives here? Are you here to teach her math?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Should I call my friend's dog?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'd rather spend my time exclusively with humans, personally.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall6.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I'm a human! You can hang out with me! It's obviously not like I have anything else planned if I'm out in the hall watching TikTok.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I guess that's that then. But I'd kind of prefer to go into your room instead of staying out here where everyone else can hear us...talk about dogs or something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall7.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean...I don’t have a problem with that...but I’m pretty sure Yumi would literally kill me if I ever let you see where she sleeps.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yumi seems like the type of person to kill you for even talking to me, so I'm glad you're at least doing that much.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall8.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...she's really got it out for you for some reason.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess even she accepts that I can't just not talk to my teacher, though.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, if we can’t go inside, what do you want to do?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall6.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! I know! How about you tell me a little more about yourself?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If we're gonna be doing that whole...informal teaching thing or whatever it was, shouldn't we like, know more about each other?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, what do you want to know, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know. Anything, really. Like...what are you good at? What are your interests?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...huh.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You know...I'm not really sure.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I haven't really had time to get reacquainted with who I am yet, but...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I've always been good at...writing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall9.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A writer? Color me impressed.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What kind of stuff do you write?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing anymore. But I feel like-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whygodwhy",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/whygodwhy.png",
      "alt": "whygodwhy"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall9.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing anymore.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall6.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, if you ever start up again, maybe you could show me something?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'll...keep that in mind...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall9.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You okay, Sensei? You look kinda pale all of a-",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall10.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chika? The fuck are you doing out there? You're bein' loud as shit.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This about that fuckin' smart dog or whatever again? How many times are you gonna watch that shit?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall11.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As many as it takes, Yumi! He's a good boy and you know it!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just keep it the fuck down, please. I'm tryin' to sleep.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall8.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, Sensei. I should...probably be heading back in now anyway.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But we should definitely do this again sometime.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sounds good to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just make sure you don't mention that I was here when you head back in or we might never be able to see each other again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene chikahall12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chikahall12.webp",
      "alt": "chikahall12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My lips are sealed~",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Chika vanishes back into her dorm room and I’m left with nothing to do once again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I guess I’ll just go home and hang out with Ami or something...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
